2. GAME IDENTITY

Title: Ain's Birthday Adventure

Genre: 2D Fantasy RPG / Action Adventure / Boss Battle / Comedy

Visual Style: Detailed retro pixel art inspired by classic top-down RPGs.

Perspective: Top-down exploration with cinematic side-view or angled camera shots when appropriate.

Tone: Funny, adventurous, chaotic, emotional, wholesome, and heartwarming.

Main Characters:

- Ain — the birthday girl and main protagonist.
- Aidil — Ain's friend, who gives her a birthday present but unexpectedly transforms into a giant monster.
- Angel 1 — the calm, responsible angel.
- Angel 2 — the loud, chaotic, comedic angel.
- Angel 3 — the cheerful angel.
- The villagers — innocent townspeople who need Ain's help.

Estimated Gameplay Length: Approximately 10–20 minutes, depending on exploration and combat.

Primary Objective: Guide Ain through a birthday adventure, save the village from the Shadow Titan, rescue Aidil, and celebrate Ain's birthday.

